  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Booklet: [7] p. on sheet folded accordion-style (15 cm.). The brief story appears on p. [1]-[2] and is followed by a bibliography of invented titles, p. [5]-[7]. Puzzle: 18 pieces of laser-cut plywood. When assembled the color offset halftone on one side depicts a collage of cigar boxes, on the other, the notes to the story. Inserted in pocket of booklet is a printed sheet, 41 x 25.5 cm., folded to 13 x 10 cm. It depicts the collage on one side and the notes on the other, and so serves as key to the puzzle.</subfield>
  </datafield>
